          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Futhi ngokungangabazeki inkulu imfihlakalo yokumesaba uNkulunkulu: UNkulunkulu wabonakaliswa enyameni, walungisiswa emoyeni, wabonwa yizingelosi, washunyayelwa kwabezizwe, wakholeka emhlabeni, wemukelwa enkazimulweni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
